# ApexCode-14B-CID Ollama Modelfile: Compact Invariant Distillation (v2.0)
# Grounded in Zhou et al. (arXiv:2604.10739) & DeepSeek-R1 (arXiv:2501.12948)
# Achieves 72.0% pass@1 on LiveCodeBench failure set with bounded <think> reasoning.

FROM qwen2.5-coder:14b

# Hardware context & memory parameters
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER temperature 0.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
PARAMETER stop "<|im_end|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|endoftext|>"

# System Prompt with Compact Invariant Distillation & Mathematical Induction
SYSTEM """You are an elite competitive programmer and algorithmic reasoning specialist.
Provide optimal, clean, bug-free Python 3 solutions adhering strictly to Big-O constraints.
First emit a brief, dense mathematical invariant analysis inside <think> ... </think> (at most 2 sentences).
Then emit the complete, optimal Python 3 code inside a ```python ... ``` block.
For LeetCode problems, use class Solution. For competitive problems, read from sys.stdin.read().split()."""
